# Note: apps/dashboard and apps/docs are NOT excluded — bun's workspace
# install requires every workspace's package.json to be present. Their
# source ships in the image but is never executed (the Fly entrypoint
# only runs --filter @railforge/{api,worker,indexer}). Both apps deploy
# separately to Cloudflare Workers Static Assets.

